      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c725e1b7b2dccd37",
      "translationZh": "查看由 Changze Li 及另外 5 位作者撰写的论文《BEACON：面向网络威胁情报的行为锚定跨来源知识图谱构建》的 PDF",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "215d3f17e4b9e713",
